Hey, y'all! We are a husband and wife from Nashville, Tennessee. 

We started our YouTube channel on a whim when we decided to take a year off &amp; go travel back in 2016. 1 year quickly turned into 4, &amp; at the very end of 2019 we stepped foot in our 100th country. If you want a quick summary of that journey you can watch the documentary here - https://bit.ly/41TbOKJ

